### Autenticação JWT - Login
POST https://localhost:7000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dev@martech.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

###

### Exemplo com credenciais inválidas
POST https://localhost:7000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wrong@email.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Testar endpoint protegido (substitua {TOKEN} pelo token recebido)
GET https://localhost:7000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {TOKEN}

###
